{"page":355,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:37","surah":24,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"رِجَالٌ لَّا تُلْهِيهِمْ تِجَـٰرَةٌ وَلَا بَيْعٌ عَن ذِكْرِ ٱللَّهِ وَإِقَامِ ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ وَإِيتَآءِ ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۙ يَخَافُونَ يَوْمًا تَتَقَلَّبُ فِيهِ ٱلْقُلُوبُ وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"men who are not distracted, either by commerce or profit, from remembering God, keeping up the prayer, and paying the prescribed alms, fearing a day when hearts and eyes will turn over.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رِجَالٌۭ","en_gloss":"Men ","transliteration":"rijālun","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تُلْهِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"distracts them","transliteration":"tul'hīhim","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تِجَـٰرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"trade","transliteration":"tijāratun","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْعٌ","en_gloss":"sale","transliteration":"bayʿun","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance of Allah","transliteration":"dhik'ri","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the) remembrance of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَإِقَامِ","en_gloss":"and (from) establishing","transliteration":"wa-iqāmi","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِيتَآءِ","en_gloss":"and giving","transliteration":"waītāi","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۙ","en_gloss":"zakah","transliteration":"l-zakati","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"They fear","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a Day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَتَقَلَّبُ","en_gloss":"will turn about","transliteration":"tataqallabu","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْقُلُوبُ","en_gloss":"the hearts","transliteration":"l-qulūbu","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"and the eyes","transliteration":"wal-abṣāru","verse_key":"24:37"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:37"}]},{"verse_key":"24:38","surah":24,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِيَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ أَحْسَنَ مَا عَمِلُوا۟ وَيَزِيدَهُم مِّن فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَرْزُقُ مَن يَشَآءُ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will reward such people according to the best of their actions, and He will give them more of His bounty: God provides limitlessly for anyone He will.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَجْزِيَهُمُ","en_gloss":"That Allah may reward them","transliteration":"liyajziyahumu","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"That Allah may reward them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"(with the) best","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَزِيدَهُم","en_gloss":"and increase them","transliteration":"wayazīdahum","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَرْزُقُ","en_gloss":"provides","transliteration":"yarzuqu","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حِسَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"measure","transliteration":"ḥisābin","verse_key":"24:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:38"}]},{"verse_key":"24:39","surah":24,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ كَسَرَابٍۭ بِقِيعَةٍ يَحْسَبُهُ ٱلظَّمْـَٔانُ مَآءً حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا جَآءَهُۥ لَمْ يَجِدْهُ شَيْـًٔا وَوَجَدَ ٱللَّهَ عِندَهُۥ فَوَفَّىٰهُ حِسَابَهُۥ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But the deeds of those who disbelieve are like a mirage in a desert: the thirsty person thinks there will be water but, when he gets there, he finds only God, who pays him his account in full- God is swift in reckoning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmāluhum","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَسَرَابٍۭ","en_gloss":"(are) like a mirage","transliteration":"kasarābin","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِقِيعَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"in a lowland","transliteration":"biqīʿatin","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَحْسَبُهُ","en_gloss":"thinks it","transliteration":"yaḥsabuhu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظَّمْـَٔانُ","en_gloss":"the thirsty one","transliteration":"l-ẓamānu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَآءً","en_gloss":"(to be) water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَآءَهُۥ","en_gloss":"he comes to it","transliteration":"jāahu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَجِدْهُ","en_gloss":"he finds it","transliteration":"yajid'hu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"(to be) anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَوَجَدَ","en_gloss":"but he finds","transliteration":"wawajada","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عِندَهُۥ","en_gloss":"before him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَوَفَّىٰهُ","en_gloss":"He will pay him in full","transliteration":"fawaffāhu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حِسَابَهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"his due","transliteration":"ḥisābahu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":21,"ar":"سَرِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) swift","transliteration":"sarīʿu","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_gloss":"(in) the account","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","verse_key":"24:39"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:39"}]},{"verse_key":"24:40","surah":24,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"أَوْ كَظُلُمَـٰتٍ فِى بَحْرٍ لُّجِّىٍّ يَغْشَىٰهُ مَوْجٌ مِّن فَوْقِهِۦ مَوْجٌ مِّن فَوْقِهِۦ سَحَابٌ ۚ ظُلُمَـٰتٌۢ بَعْضُهَا فَوْقَ بَعْضٍ إِذَآ أَخْرَجَ يَدَهُۥ لَمْ يَكَدْ يَرَىٰهَا ۗ وَمَن لَّمْ يَجْعَلِ ٱللَّهُ لَهُۥ نُورًا فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن نُّورٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Or like shadows in a deep sea covered by wave upon wave, with clouds above- layer upon layer of darkness- if he holds out his hand, he is scarcely able to see it. The one to whom God gives no light has no light at all.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَظُلُمَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(is) like (the) darkness[es]","transliteration":"kaẓulumātin","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"24:40"},{"