","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":26,"ar":"يَجْعَلِ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) made","transliteration":"yajʿali","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) made","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":28,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":29,"ar":"نُورًۭا","en_gloss":"a light","transliteration":"nūran","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":30,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":31,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":32,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(is) any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":33,"ar":"نُّورٍ","en_gloss":"light","transliteration":"nūrin","verse_key":"24:40"},{"pos":34,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"24:40"}]},{"verse_key":"24:41","surah":24,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُسَبِّحُ لَهُۥ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱلطَّيْرُ صَـٰٓفَّـٰتٍ ۖ كُلٌّ قَدْ عَلِمَ صَلَاتَهُۥ وَتَسْبِيحَهُۥ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِمَا يَفْعَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], do you not see that all those who are in the heavens and earth praise God, as do the birds with wings outstretched? Each knows its [own way] of prayer and glorification: God has full knowledge of what they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُ","en_gloss":"glorify","transliteration":"yusabbiḥu","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"24:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"ma